  "goodToKnow": "Das Stilmittel is a stylistic or rhetorical device: Metapher, Vergleich, Alliteration, Anapher, Ironie. Analysing Stilmittel and their effect (Wirkung) is a standard task in German school essays (Gedichtanalyse). A fixed alliterative pair like Kind und Kegel or Haus und Hof is called a Zwillingsformel. The plural is the same: die Stilmittel."
